    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Paris-based creative developer/designer, solo practice since around 2014 per his own site. Founder of Tunnel Vision (his own registered French company, sole director) and co-founder of the duo HTTB.EU, also credited as Head of Digital for Naima Publication. Studied mathematics then graphic design at ESAG Penninghen before moving into creative coding. Clients include Marine Serre, Nodaleto, D'heygere, Kamel Mennour and Soulwax, featured on Awwwards and Siteinspire. Reads as senior, self directed independent practitioner, around 10 years in, no first hand evidence of leading a larger team beyond the HTTB.EU duo so Autonomy estimated at 4, hedged. Work Status Freelance: his own site presents as a personal solo portfolio (no employer named) and the Creative Review profile independently corroborates the solo/founder status, two sources agree; LinkedIn profile found but not checked for conflicting signal.",
